<title>USA: TABLE-Fed Reserve business loans rose July 23 wk.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fed Reserve business loans rose July 23 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JULY 16</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............821,300 up.....2,800</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......722,100 down..10,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......594,800 down...4,600</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JULY 23</p>
<p>U.S. commercial paper.....871,847 down.....196</p>
<p> Financial companies.......674,899 up.....2,024</p>
<p> New York business loans....47,512 up.......434</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......47,233 up.......434</p>
</text>
